%% System L11: BSS period report — compiler presets → PostgREST RPC (eng)
%% Complements L6 (agent path). Sales phrases stay on pitch.md / L0b.
flowchart TB
  U[Owner: laporan …] --> SOUL[SOUL + kasir-tools]
  SOUL --> COMP[period compiler<br/>Asia/Jakarta]
  COMP -->|preset OK| RPC["POST /rpc/kasir_period_report<br/>tenant + from/to + top_n"]
  COMP -->|tahun angka / dari-sampai| REF[Refuse / arahkan preset]
  COMP -->|triwulan ambigu| ASK[Clarify: kuartal vs 3 bulan]
  RPC -->|KASIR_PERIOD_RPC=1| DB[(SQL aggregate<br/>DEFINER)]
  RPC -->|KASIR_PERIOD_RPC=0| OFF[Fail-closed user_safe<br/>no REST fallback]
  DB -->|JSON omzet belanja top-N| FMT[Format WA]
  FMT --> U
  REF --> U
  ASK --> U
  OFF --> U

  subgraph presets["Presets v1"]
    P1[today week month]
    P2[quarter / quarter_last]
    P3[last_3_months]
    P4[year YTD / last_year]
  end
  COMP -.-> presets
